      "cooked": "<p>Had a game tonight with Matriarch in Omnitron-IV.&nbsp; While an Internal Defense Grid was in play, Muninn came out.&nbsp; Other rulings have said that a card \"enters play\" before its text takes effect, so does Muninn take a point from the IDG?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>It seemed to me that if he was sufficiently in play to have HP, then he probably also had his DR, but I figured it was worth checking.</p>",
